1
00:00:03,428 --> 00:00:05,428
[PLAYING CLASSICAL MUSIC]

2
00:00:09,726 --> 00:00:12,316
(Lesley:)I admire your fingering.

3
00:00:12,729 --> 00:00:14,439
(Penny:)Thank you.

4
00:00:15,273 --> 00:00:18,403
Maybe sometime you can
try that on my instrument.

5
00:00:27,201 --> 00:00:28,911
LESLIE: Good night, guys. Good job.
- Thanks.

6
00:00:29,078 --> 00:00:30,578
(Female string quartettist:)See you next week.

7
00:00:30,913 --> 00:00:33,583
